OL,3,GNEWSAMen charged after migrant
OL,4,Asmuggling investigation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have appeared in court
OL,7,Ffollowing an investigation into the
OL,8,Falleged unlawful entry of hundreds of
OL,9,Fmigrants by air into the UK.
OL,11,FThe investigation was led by the South
OL,12,FEast Regional Organised Crime Unit
OL,13,F(SEROCU) with support from Europol and
OL,14,Fpolice forces across the continent.
OL,16,FIqbal Khokhar, 58, of Slough, Iljit
OL,17,FChopra, 49, of Brentford, and Adil
OL,18,FKhan, 41, of Newham in east London,
OL,19,Fappeared at East Berkshire Magistrates'
OL,20,FCourt in Slough.
OL,22,FThey were all remanded in custody.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
